DESCRIPTION >
    Regression scenario for the reported tb 4.1.14 breaking change: a date
    stored inside a native JSON column subcolumn, cast with toDate() and
    compared against a date query parameter. Note: PyPI has no 4.1.13/4.1.14
    tinybird release, so this is a synthetic reproduction of the reported
    failure pattern (JSON subcolumn dynamic typing vs. a Date() templated
    parameter), not a confirmed repro of that exact historical bug. JSON_TYPE
    is force-enabled inside the tinybird-local Docker image regardless of the
    workspace flag, and the bundled ClickHouse version in that image has
    changed several times; if this ever regresses again, bisect by pinning
    tinybird-local Docker image tags rather than tb CLI pip versions.

SCHEMA >
    `row_id` String `json:$.row_id`,
    `payload` JSON `json:$.payload`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "row_id"
